# L1-OUT-003 / L2-ERR-005 pinning: an errored RT15 record, its SPURIOUS_DATA
# continuation (decoder code 0x2000), and a clean RT3 record -- all at one
# TIME_STAMP. The RT3 row sorts ahead of RT15, but the continuation has no
# RT/MSG of its own and must stay immediately after the errored record it
# continues, or the 0x2000 code would describe nothing.

# RT15 SA11 Receive, ERRORED (Type Word bit 14)
0248 0F18 20DB F401 7E79 0000 0000 1E01

# SPURIOUS_DATA continuation -> 0x2000, must stay adjacent
2005 0F18 20DB F401 0000

# RT3 SA11 Receive - clean, sorts ahead of RT15
0224 0F18 20DB F401 7E19 0004 0000 0000
2F00 22CA 2F00 22CA 0000 0000 0000 0000
0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000
0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000
0000 0000 71C7 0018
